# Times are local (the container's TZ, from .env).
#
# "Nightly" runs in the morning: last night's sleep and HRV only exist after
# the watch syncs when you wake up. It runs twice to catch a late sync; every
# step is an upsert, so the second run just refreshes. The 04:00 run picks up
# yesterday's workouts and logs early; sleep and HRV arrive with the later runs.
0 4 * * *    healthtracker nightly
30 7 * * *   healthtracker nightly
30 10 * * *  healthtracker nightly

# Weekly learning loop: insights, tuning proposals, experiments, next week's plan.
0 20 * * 0   healthtracker weekly
